{"4973630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Descent", "steam_appid": 4973630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5037380], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/b82d5f33483bf82c2508e85f7bd65c41.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/b82d5f33483bf82c2508e85f7bd65c41.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/b82d5f33483bf82c2508e85f7bd65c41.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No story, no dialogue - Void Descent is only here to offer pure bullet heaven action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your ship and destroy everything that comes at you. Weapons fire automatically so you can focus entirely on movement, positioning, and survival using mouse, keyboard, or controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/7c3a9d82d10992bc67ba1034ce53ff9f.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/7c3a9d82d10992bc67ba1034ce53ff9f.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/7c3a9d82d10992bc67ba1034ce53ff9f.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 80 billion loadout combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your weapon loadout with 5 distinct elemental types. Boost each element's effectiveness with dedicated Mastery Upgrades, then amplify your power even further with Elemental Synergies combining two elements to unleash devastating fusion effects and unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/9c176965d08d2faecfa5c739dc014ef9.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/9c176965d08d2faecfa5c739dc014ef9.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/9c176965d08d2faecfa5c739dc014ef9.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playing it safe isn't an option here. Void Descent forces you on the offensive with a real-time Combat Rank system.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay aggressive, weave through swarms, and thread the needle through enemy fire to push your rank to the limit. Fall back or take hits, and your rank tanks fast. The higher your Combat Rank, the more massive your score multiplier grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/ccbbc48e3e614fe0353e094a023bb82c.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/ccbbc48e3e614fe0353e094a023bb82c.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/ccbbc48e3e614fe0353e094a023bb82c.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow down time whenever you want with Time Dilation because why restrict something this fun with a cooldown?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Releasing your controls instantly drops time to 10% speed. Evaluate the swarm, line up your next move, soak in the weapon effects, or answer the colleague who just called your name on a work call. When you're ready, start steering again to smoothly ramp back to full speed and plunge straight into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/a3dca18d8694186b6e24b02f1bc28292.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/a3dca18d8694186b6e24b02f1bc28292.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/a3dca18d8694186b6e24b02f1bc28292.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Descent offers 2 completely different graphics modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 2D offers that classic vector arcade feel with maximum visual clarity while saving battery when playing on handhelds. Modern 3D showcases high-fidelity space combat, detailed ship models, and rich lighting when you have graphical horsepower to spare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/334cf6e93880ff00033bf2470d909562.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/334cf6e93880ff00033bf2470d909562.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/334cf6e93880ff00033bf2470d909562.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Augment Lab to unlock game-changing offensive, defensive, and utility perks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use resources harvested from Titans and Nexus Prime to unlock augments and construct absurd synergies to tackle Ascension tiers and push deep into Endless Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/e6baf80b89bb4f5cdb5f17acc61159fe.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/e6baf80b89bb4f5cdb5f17acc61159fe.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/e6baf80b89bb4f5cdb5f17acc61159fe.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just you, your loadout, and the will to live.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After conquering all 5 Ascension tiers, unlock the endless Void Descent Mode. Equip up to 3 augments, adapt to randomized debuffs every 10 waves, and battle escalating Titans every two minutes. Reach periodic checkpoints to cleanse debuffs, repair your hull, or stack even more augments to create a truly broken build. How long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Void Descent</i></strong><i> is a solo passion project built for fans of high-octane action roguelikes. A huge thank you to everyone who has played the demo and shared feedback so far. I'm actively building and tuning this game based on what you think. I hope you enjoy!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/b82d5f33483bf82c2508e85f7bd65c41.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/b82d5f33483bf82c2508e85f7bd65c41.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/b82d5f33483bf82c2508e85f7bd65c41.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No story, no dialogue - Void Descent is only here to offer pure bullet heaven action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your ship and destroy everything that comes at you. Weapons fire automatically so you can focus entirely on movement, positioning, and survival using mouse, keyboard, or controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/7c3a9d82d10992bc67ba1034ce53ff9f.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/7c3a9d82d10992bc67ba1034ce53ff9f.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/7c3a9d82d10992bc67ba1034ce53ff9f.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 80 billion loadout combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your weapon loadout with 5 distinct elemental types. Boost each element's effectiveness with dedicated Mastery Upgrades, then amplify your power even further with Elemental Synergies combining two elements to unleash devastating fusion effects and unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/9c176965d08d2faecfa5c739dc014ef9.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/9c176965d08d2faecfa5c739dc014ef9.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/9c176965d08d2faecfa5c739dc014ef9.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playing it safe isn't an option here. Void Descent forces you on the offensive with a real-time Combat Rank system.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay aggressive, weave through swarms, and thread the needle through enemy fire to push your rank to the limit. Fall back or take hits, and your rank tanks fast. The higher your Combat Rank, the more massive your score multiplier grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/ccbbc48e3e614fe0353e094a023bb82c.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/ccbbc48e3e614fe0353e094a023bb82c.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/ccbbc48e3e614fe0353e094a023bb82c.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow down time whenever you want with Time Dilation because why restrict something this fun with a cooldown?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Releasing your controls instantly drops time to 10% speed. Evaluate the swarm, line up your next move, soak in the weapon effects, or answer the colleague who just called your name on a work call. When you're ready, start steering again to smoothly ramp back to full speed and plunge straight into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/a3dca18d8694186b6e24b02f1bc28292.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/a3dca18d8694186b6e24b02f1bc28292.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/a3dca18d8694186b6e24b02f1bc28292.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Descent offers 2 completely different graphics modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 2D offers that classic vector arcade feel with maximum visual clarity while saving battery when playing on handhelds. Modern 3D showcases high-fidelity space combat, detailed ship models, and rich lighting when you have graphical horsepower to spare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/334cf6e93880ff00033bf2470d909562.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/334cf6e93880ff00033bf2470d909562.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/334cf6e93880ff00033bf2470d909562.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Augment Lab to unlock game-changing offensive, defensive, and utility perks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use resources harvested from Titans and Nexus Prime to unlock augments and construct absurd synergies to tackle Ascension tiers and push deep into Endless Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/e6baf80b89bb4f5cdb5f17acc61159fe.poster.avif?t=1787156637\" width=852 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/e6baf80b89bb4f5cdb5f17acc61159fe.webm?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/extras/e6baf80b89bb4f5cdb5f17acc61159fe.mp4?t=1787156637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just you, your loadout, and the will to live.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After conquering all 5 Ascension tiers, unlock the endless Void Descent Mode. Equip up to 3 augments, adapt to randomized debuffs every 10 waves, and battle escalating Titans every two minutes. Reach periodic checkpoints to cleanse debuffs, repair your hull, or stack even more augments to create a truly broken build. How long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Void Descent</i></strong><i> is a solo passion project built for fans of high-octane action roguelikes. A huge thank you to everyone who has played the demo and shared feedback so far. I'm actively building and tuning this game based on what you think. I hope you enjoy!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Void Descent is a fast-paced bullet heaven where aggression is mandatory. Weave through swarms and maximize DPS to raise your Combat Rank or release the controls to slow time and plan your next move. Explore over 80 billion loadout combinations with weapons, elemental mods, and unlockable augments!", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“All my favorite types of roguelike/survivorslike abilities are here, from chain lightning to the ability to hack enemies to fight for you, turrets, drones, crazy ultimates - it goes on and on. Rare to see so many nicely chosen ability upgrades in one survivorslike.”<br>TowerofSisyphus<br><br>“&quot;One more run&quot; and two hours passed. What a gem.”<br>fatpugstudio<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/6a3f3375fc5bf75f058a03ee935070081c04be15/header.jpg?t=1787156637", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/feb4a0008985fecb52a1301067e89c28ab3cec89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787156637", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4973630/feb4a0008985fecb52a1301067e89c28ab3cec89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787156637", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a